          "smithy.api#documentation": "\u003cp\u003eReturns the current account customization settings, including account color, visible services, and visible Regions. Settings that you have not configured return their default values: visible Regions and visible services return `null`, and account color returns `none`.\u003c/p\u003e \u003cnote\u003e \u003cp\u003eThe \u003ccode\u003evisibleServices\u003c/code\u003e and \u003ccode\u003evisibleRegions\u003c/code\u003e settings control only the appearance of services and Regions in the Amazon Web Services Management Console. They do not restrict access through the CLI, SDKs, or other APIs.\u003c/p\u003e \u003c/note\u003e",
          "smithy.api#examples": [
            {
              "title": "Get account customizations",
              "documentation": "Retrieves all account customization settings",
              "input": {},
              "output": {
                "accountColor": "green",
                "visibleServices": [
                  "s3",
                  "ec2"
                ],
                "visibleRegions": [
                  "us-east-1",
                  "us-west-2"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
